  "description": "Heejae is the youngest executive director of the Jinhwa Group, nicknamed the \"Chaebol Prince\" by the public. But his life is turned upside down when documents linking him to an embezzlement scheme are found by an accounting student, Taekyung! To make sure the secret stays that way, Heejae pretends to have a crush on him, but... is there more to Taekyung than meets the eye? Watch sparks fly as this chaebol rom-com begins! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
